# Sync with CLAUDE.md

This project is used with **both Cursor and Claude**. `CLAUDE.md` at the repo root is the shared source of truth.

When you change project context, the developer profile, the current plan, or how to work on this repo:

1. Update the relevant file(s) in `.cursor/rules/`
2. Update the matching section(s) in `CLAUDE.md` in the same change

Do not let Cursor rules and `CLAUDE.md` drift apart. If unsure which file to edit, update `CLAUDE.md` first, then mirror into `.cursor/rules/`.
